{
  "an6.19:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 6.19 ",
  "an6.19:0.2": "2. Sāraṇīyavagga ",
  "an6.19:0.3": "Paṭhamamaraṇassatisutta ",
  "an6.19:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā nātike viharati giñjakāvasathe. ",
  "an6.19:1.2": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "an6.19:1.3": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "an6.19:1.4": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "an6.19:1.5": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an6.19:1.6": "“maraṇassati, bhikkhave, bhāvitā bahulīkatā mahapphalā hoti mahānisaṁsā amatogadhā amatapariyosānā. ",
  "an6.19:1.7": "Bhāvetha no tumhe, bhikkhave, maraṇassatin”ti? ",
  "an6.19:2.1": "Evaṁ vutte, aññataro bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an6.19:2.2": "“ahaṁ kho, bhante, bhāvemi maraṇassatin”ti. ",
  "an6.19:2.3": "“Yathā kathaṁ pana tvaṁ, bhikkhu, bhāvesi maraṇassatin”ti? ",
  "an6.19:2.4": "“Idha mayhaṁ, bhante, evaṁ hoti: ",
  "an6.19:2.5": "‘aho vatāhaṁ rattindivaṁ jīveyyaṁ, bhagavato sāsanaṁ manasi kareyyaṁ, bahu vata me kataṁ assā’ti. ",
  "an6.19:2.6": "Evaṁ kho ahaṁ, bhante, bhāvemi maraṇassatin”ti. ",
  "an6.19:3.1": "Aññataropi kho bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an6.19:3.2": "“ahampi kho, bhante, bhāvemi maraṇassatin”ti. ",
  "an6.19:3.3": "“Yathā kathaṁ pana tvaṁ, bhikkhu, bhāvesi maraṇassatin”ti? ",
  "an6.19:3.4": "“Idha mayhaṁ, bhante, evaṁ hoti: ",
  "an6.19:3.5": "‘aho vatāhaṁ divasaṁ jīveyyaṁ, bhagavato sāsanaṁ manasi kare